      "seed": 1373158607,
      "version": 300,
      "versionNonce": 723182119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137330266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirements:\n   - learner / tutor view upcoming and past lessons\n   - tutor manages weekly availability\n   - learner searches tutors (language, price, country, availability in own timezone) -> ranked list\n   - learner views tutor profile & free slots\n   - learner books a lesson (trial / regular) -> pays -> confirmed\n   - learner cancels a lesson",
      "originalText": "Functional requirements:\n   - learner / tutor view upcoming and past lessons\n   - tutor manages weekly availability\n   - learner searches tutors (language, price, country, availability in own timezone) -> ranked list\n   - learner views tutor profile & free slots\n   - learner books a lesson (trial / regular) -> pays -> confirmed\n   - learner cancels a lesson",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a0",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kqfWypSrykSCE9Zy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -615.088251628426,
      "y": 121.01765321788685,
      "width": 473.8072509765625,
      "height": 91.55444382765589,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 53710185,
      "version": 347,
      "versionNonce": 837420359,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137330266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Out of scope:\n   - auth, messaging, reviews, tutor payouts, subscriptions\n   - reschedule = cancel + new lesson booking\n   - classroom (live lesson)",
      "originalText": "Out of scope:\n   - auth, messaging, reviews, tutor payouts, subscriptions\n   - reschedule = cancel + new lesson booking\n   - classroom (live lesson)",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a1",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qy_m8AYBR_qMObID",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -619.2167145040862,
      "y": 263.40861966225043,
      "width": 590.8629760742188,
      "height": 183.10888765531178,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 590620972,
      "version": 348,
      "versionNonce": 1428669543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137330266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional requirements:\n   - search: p95 <= 300ms, highly available >> consistent (eventual, sec)\n   - lesson booking: NO double booking, consistency >> availability\n   - durable lesson bookings & payments (never lose a lesson)\n   - 150k tutors, ~5M MAU learners, 180 countries \n   - read >> write: ~100:1 (search vs booking)\n   - scale for peaks (promo, Jan/Sep): 10x bursts\n   - security: authz per resource, PII, PCI via provider",
      "originalText": "Non functional requirements:\n   - search: p95 <= 300ms, highly available >> consistent (eventual, sec)\n   - lesson booking: NO double booking, consistency >> availability\n   - durable lesson bookings & payments (never lose a lesson)\n   - 150k tutors, ~5M MAU learners, 180 countries \n   - read >> write: ~100:1 (search vs booking)\n   - scale for peaks (promo, Jan/Sep): 10x bursts\n   - security: authz per resource, PII, PCI via provider",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a2",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oyppv0eqfhWlmA09",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -611.0429348293213,
      "y": 507.8164336100781,
      "width": 212.26754760742188,
      "height": 137.33166574148385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 479341424,
      "version": 326,
      "versionNonce": 1151377287,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137330266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core entities:\n   - Learner\n   - Tutor\n   - Slot - tutor availability\n   - Lesson\n   - Payment",
      "originalText": "Core entities:\n   - Learner\n   - Tutor\n   - Slot - tutor availability\n   - Lesson\n   - Payment",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "U067v3snTQcDinjV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -617.000318766236,
      "y": 707.5022978313435,
      "width": 814.373046875,
      "height": 709.5469396643331,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1581559893,
      "version": 501,
      "versionNonce": 43062951,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137330266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API:\n   - my lessons (upcoming / history)\n     GET /api/v1/lessons?status=upcoming|completed|cancelled&from&to&cursor -> Lesson[]\n     GET /api/v1/lessons/{id} -> Lesson (+ tutor, slot, payment status)\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n - tutor manages availability\n     PUT /api/v1/tutors/{id}/availability\n     HEADERS: JWT\n     { weeklyRules[], exceptions[], timezone }\n\n  - search tutors (ranked)\n     GET /api/v1/tutors?lang&price_min&price_max&country&avail_from&avail_to&timezone&cursor \n            -> Tutor[ ]\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n   - tutor availability (calendar view)\n     GET /api/v1/tutors/{id}/slots?from&to&timezone\n          -> Slot[]\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n   - book a lesson\n     POST /api/v1/lessons-> Lesson {status: held -> booked after payment}\n     HEADERS: JWT + Idempotency-Key\n     {\n        tutorId, slotStart (UTC), durationMin, type: trial | regular\n     }\n\n   - cancel a lesson\n     DELETE /api/v1/lessons/{id} -> cancelled\n     HEADERS: JWT",
      "originalText": "API:\n   - my lessons (upcoming / history)\n     GET /api/v1/lessons?status=upcoming|completed|cancelled&from&to&cursor -> Lesson[]\n     GET /api/v1/lessons/{id} -> Lesson (+ tutor, slot, payment status)\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n - tutor manages availability\n     PUT /api/v1/tutors/{id}/availability\n     HEADERS: JWT\n     { weeklyRules[], exceptions[], timezone }\n\n  - search tutors (ranked)\n     GET /api/v1/tutors?lang&price_min&price_max&country&avail_from&avail_to&timezone&cursor \n            -> Tutor[ ]\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n   - tutor availability (calendar view)\n     GET /api/v1/tutors/{id}/slots?from&to&timezone\n          -> Slot[]\n     HEADERS: JWT\n\n   - book a lesson\n     POST /api/v1/lessons-> Lesson {status: held -> booked after payment}\n     HEADERS: JWT + Idempotency-Key\n     {\n        tutorId, slotStart (UTC), durationMin, type: trial | regular\n     }\n\n   - cancel a lesson\n     DELETE /api/v1/lessons/{id} -> cancelled\n     HEADERS: JWT",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a4",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "auKvwQjNf6IUWF9q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -580.9623532131611,
      "y": 1754.613178258456,
      "width": 976.8753314376955,
      "height": 137.33166574148385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1453201079,
      "version": 455,
      "versionNonce": 814906599,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137334300,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimation:\n   - 1M DAU learners x 5 searches = 5*10^6 / 10^5 s = 50 rps avg x 10-20 peak = ~1k rps search (read heavy)\n   - lesson bookings: ~100k lessons/day -> ~1 rps avg, ~20 rps peak\n   - slots: 150k tutors x 8 weeks x 7 x 48 (30m) = ~400M rows x 60B = ~25GB\n   - lesson bookings: 100k/day x 365 x 5y = ~180M rows x 200B = ~36GB\n   - ES: 150k tutor docs x 2KB = 300MB -> fits in RAM, replicas x3",
      "originalText": "Estimation:\n   - 1M DAU learners x 5 searches = 5*10^6 / 10^5 s = 50 rps avg x 10-20 peak = ~1k rps search (read heavy)\n   - lesson bookings: ~100k lessons/day -> ~1 rps avg, ~20 rps peak\n   - slots: 150k tutors x 8 weeks x 7 x 48 (30m) = ~400M rows x 60B = ~25GB\n   - lesson bookings: 100k/day x 365 x 5y = ~180M rows x 200B = ~36GB\n   - ES: 150k tutor docs x 2KB = 300MB -> fits in RAM, replicas x3",
      "fontSize": 18.31088876553118,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a5",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
