      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793970544233,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lesson booking flow (saga):\n   1. POST /lesson+ Idempotency-Key\n\n      UPDATE slot SET status='held', hold_expires_at=now()+10m\n      WHERE tutor_id=? AND start_at=? AND status='available'\n      -> 0 rows = 409 Conflict\n\n   2. create payment intent at provider (client pays)\n   3. webhook (verify signature, idempotent) -> held -> booked\n      + outbox event in the same tx\n   4. hold expired -> reaper job -> available again\n   5. cancel -> booked -> cancelled -> refund (compensating step)\n   Timezones: store UTC; rules in tutor tz (DST safe);\n   convert per learner tz on read",
      "originalText": "Lesson booking flow (saga):\n   1. POST /lesson+ Idempotency-Key\n\n      UPDATE slot SET status='held', hold_expires_at=now()+10m\n      WHERE tutor_id=? AND start_at=? AND status='available'\n      -> 0 rows = 409 Conflict\n\n   2. create payment intent at provider (client pays)\n   3. webhook (verify signature, idempotent) -> held -> booked\n      + outbox event in the same tx\n   4. hold expired -> reaper job -> available again\n   5. cancel -> booked -> cancelled -> refund (compensating step)\n   Timezones: store UTC; rules in tutor tz (DST safe);\n   convert per learner tz on read",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0l",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KhM4OVzqWmRRAveL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 853.9640453376393,
      "y": 1088.686457575094,
      "width": 488.815673828125,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1880879863,
      "version": 407,
      "versionNonce": 1937122759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137299249,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solution to lesson double booking:\n   ❌ 1. check-then-insert in app code\n        - race between read and write\n   ⚠️ 2. distributed lock (Redis SETNX + TTL)\n        - extra hop, lock lost on failover\n        - ok for tickets surge, overkill here\n   ✅ 3. DB-level: conditional UPDATE  + UNIQUE(tutor_id, start_at)\n        - 0 rows updated = 409, atomic, no lock service\n        - hold with TTL + reaper, idempotency key\n        - one row per slot -> no hot partition",
      "originalText": "Solution to lesson double booking:\n   ❌ 1. check-then-insert in app code\n        - race between read and write\n   ⚠️ 2. distributed lock (Redis SETNX + TTL)\n        - extra hop, lock lost on failover\n        - ok for tickets surge, overkill here\n   ✅ 3. DB-level: conditional UPDATE  + UNIQUE(tutor_id, start_at)\n        - 0 rows updated = 409, atomic, no lock service\n        - hold with TTL + reaper, idempotency key\n        - one row per slot -> no hot partition",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0m",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
