      "text": "Lesson table:\n   - id (pk), idempotency_key (unique)\n   - tutor_id\n   - learner_id\n   - start_at (UTC)\n   - duration_min\n   - status: held | booked | completed | cancelled\n   - payment_id\n   - price\n   - currency\n   - created_at\n   - updated_at",
      "originalText": "Lesson table:\n   - id (pk), idempotency_key (unique)\n   - tutor_id\n   - learner_id\n   - start_at (UTC)\n   - duration_min\n   - status: held | booked | completed | cancelled\n   - payment_id\n   - price\n   - currency\n   - created_at\n   - updated_at",
