    {
      "id": "tbg2-3zeXtfYq9iN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 858.1017302401592,
      "y": 1375.9516585148908,
      "width": 348.92156982421875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 640905301,
      "version": 283,
      "versionNonce": 1601961799,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137303302,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Security:\n   - authz: learner sees own lessons, tutor own calendar\n   - PII minimized, cards never stored (PCI -> provider)\n   - rate limit search & book (per user / IP), anti-scraping\n   - webhook signature + idempotency (replay safe)\n   - signed URLs for media",
      "originalText": "Security:\n   - authz: learner sees own lessons, tutor own calendar\n   - PII minimized, cards never stored (PCI -> provider)\n   - rate limit search & book (per user / IP), anti-scraping\n   - webhook signature + idempotency (replay safe)\n   - signed URLs for media",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0s",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2FGY-5Q-Ftip5ZYZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490.1064624675055,
      "y": 1748.4082553159758,
      "width": 780.2889404296875,
      "height": 367.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1372133588,
      "version": 434,
      "versionNonce": 624470759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794137332333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trade-offs:\n   Search\n   - eventual (AP) for search vs strong (CP) for lesson booking\n   - Postgres + ES (ranking, facets, offload reads) vs Postgres full-text (one store, simpler)\n   - precomputed ML scores in Redis (cheap, fast) vs online scoring (fresh, +latency, +cost)\n   - result cache 60s (fewer ES hits) vs freshness (slot may look free for a minute)\n\n   Data store\n   - PostgreSQL for slots/lessons (ACID, UNIQUE, row-level tx) vs NoSQL (scale, but no cross-row atomicity)\n   - materialized slots (O(1) check, simple UNIQUE) vs rules-only (less storage, compute on read, hard to lock)\n   - hold in Postgres + reaper (durable, no phantom holds) vs Redis TTL (faster, lost on failover)\n   - conditional UPDATE + UNIQUE (atomic, no extra infra) vs Redis lock (extra hop, lease expiry)\n   - shard by tutor_id (lesson tx is single-shard) vs by learner_id (fast \"my lessons\", but booking crosses shards)\n   - read replicas for calendars & history (scale reads) vs replication lag (booking always reads primary)\n   - outbox + relay (exactly-once to Kafka, same tx) vs dual write (simple, loses events) vs CDC (no app code, Debezium ops)\n\n   Integration\n   - Kafka events (decoupled consumers, replay) vs direct sync calls (simple, tight coupling, cascading failures)\n   - idempotency key on POST (safe retries) vs client-side dedupe (unreliable)\n   - async payment via webhook (robust, source of truth = provider) vs sync charge in request (simple, blocks on provider)\n   - RTC provider (global quality, $/min) vs self-hosted SFU (control, ops) — classroom",
      "originalText": "Trade-offs:\n   Search\n   - eventual (AP) for search vs strong (CP) for lesson booking\n   - Postgres + ES (ranking, facets, offload reads) vs Postgres full-text (one store, simpler)\n   - precomputed ML scores in Redis (cheap, fast) vs online scoring (fresh, +latency, +cost)\n   - result cache 60s (fewer ES hits) vs freshness (slot may look free for a minute)\n\n   Data store\n   - PostgreSQL for slots/lessons (ACID, UNIQUE, row-level tx) vs NoSQL (scale, but no cross-row atomicity)\n   - materialized slots (O(1) check, simple UNIQUE) vs rules-only (less storage, compute on read, hard to lock)\n   - hold in Postgres + reaper (durable, no phantom holds) vs Redis TTL (faster, lost on failover)\n   - conditional UPDATE + UNIQUE (atomic, no extra infra) vs Redis lock (extra hop, lease expiry)\n   - shard by tutor_id (lesson tx is single-shard) vs by learner_id (fast \"my lessons\", but booking crosses shards)\n   - read replicas for calendars & history (scale reads) vs replication lag (booking always reads primary)\n   - outbox + relay (exactly-once to Kafka, same tx) vs dual write (simple, loses events) vs CDC (no app code, Debezium ops)\n\n   Integration\n   - Kafka events (decoupled consumers, replay) vs direct sync calls (simple, tight coupling, cascading failures)\n   - idempotency key on POST (safe retries) vs client-side dedupe (unreliable)\n   - async payment via webhook (robust, source of truth = provider) vs sync charge in request (simple, blocks on provider)\n   - RTC provider (global quality, $/min) vs self-hosted SFU (control, ops) — classroom",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0t",
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5aW4F9iVAVVamYmvHVbHl",
      "type": "arrow",
